  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'Find the distance between P(x₁, y₁) and Q(x₂, y₂) when (i) PQ is parallel to the y-axis; (ii) PQ is parallel to the x-axis. (3 marks)', 'PQ = √[(x₂ − x₁)² + (y₂ − y₁)²]. (i) If PQ is parallel to the y-axis, the x-coordinates are equal (x₁ = x₂), so PQ = √[(y₂ − y₁)²] = |y₂ − y₁|. (ii) If PQ is parallel to the x-axis, y₁ = y₂, so PQ = |x₂ − x₁|.', null, '[{"point": "Distance formula PQ = √[(x₂ − x₁)² + (y₂ − y₁)²]", "marks": 1}, {"point": "(i) parallel to y-axis: x₁ = x₂, PQ = |y₂ − y₁|", "marks": 1}, {"point": "(ii) parallel to x-axis: y₁ = y₂, PQ = |x₂ − x₁|", "marks": 1}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
