  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'A reaction is second order with respect to a reactant. How will the rate of reaction be affected if the concentration of this reactant is (i) doubled and (ii) reduced to half? (3 marks)', 'For a second-order reaction, rate = k[A]². (i) If [A] is doubled, rate = k(2[A])² = 4k[A]², so the rate becomes four times. (ii) If [A] is halved, rate = k([A]/2)² = ¼k[A]², so the rate becomes one-fourth.', null, '[{"point": "Rate = k[A]²", "marks": 1}, {"point": "(i) doubled: rate x 2² = 4 times", "marks": 1}, {"point": "(ii) halved: rate x (½)² = one-quarter", "marks": 1}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
