  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'Explain the concept of Big Data and its impact on business decision-making. (3 marks)', 'Big Data refers to datasets so large, fast-moving and varied that traditional tools cannot store or analyse them efficiently. It is described by the Vs: volume (huge amounts), velocity (generated and processed in real time), variety (structured, text, images, sensor and social media data), plus veracity (quality) and value. Impact on business decisions: companies analyse it with analytics and machine learning to make evidence-based rather than intuition-based decisions; understand customers and personalise products and marketing; forecast demand and trends (predictive analytics); optimise operations, supply chains and pricing; detect fraud and manage risk in real time; and develop new products and services. It also brings challenges - data privacy and security, data quality, cost and the need for skilled analysts.', null, '[{"point": "Big Data: extremely large, fast and varied datasets beyond traditional tools - characterised by volume, velocity, variety (veracity, value)", "marks": 1.5}, {"point": "Impact: data-driven decisions, customer insights/ personalisation, predictive analytics and forecasting, operational efficiency, risk/ fraud detection, new products; challenges - privacy, quality, skills", "marks": 1.5}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
